# get info about resource

## 200

### valid response format
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/

### inner resource
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/work/

### path with one letter resource
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=a/

### resource with underscope and dash
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/my-files_backup/

### resource with numbers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/work/projects/6/

### hidden folder = resource
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=.hidden/

### get info about file
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/testSizeFile.txt

## 400

### without parametr
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource

### empty paramert path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=

### only slashes in root
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=///

### Path traversal in root
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=../secret/

### inner path traversal
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/../../etc/passwd

## 404

### URL-encoded path in root
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=%20

### "~" valid resource name but not exist resource
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=~

### URL-encoded path folder
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=my%20folder/

### if path="/" - not resource
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=/

### not exist in root
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=non_exist/

### not exist folder
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=docs/non_exist/

### not exist parent path
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=a/b/c/d/

## edge cases

### double slash (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents//work/

### resource with long name (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa/

### get alient resource (404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=user-2-files/

# delete resource

## 204

### delete existing empty folder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=to-delete/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=to-delete/

### delete existing file
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=to-delete/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=to-delete/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=to-delete/TZ.md

### delete folder with nested content (recursive)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=deep/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=deep/nested/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=deep/nested/inner/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=deep/

### single-letter folder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=a/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=a/

### file with dash and underscore
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="my-files_backup.txt"

< src/test/resources/test-files/my-files_backup.txt
--boundary--

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=my-files_backup.txt

## 400

### without param
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource

### empty param
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=

### only slashes
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=///

### path traversal in root
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=../secret/

### inner path traversal
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/../../etc/passwd

## 404

### non-existent file
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=ghost.txt

### non-existent folder
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=non-exist/

### non-existent deep path
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=a/b/c/d/

### if path is root
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=/

### URL-encoded space
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=%20

### alien resource
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=user-2-files/

## edge cases

### delete empty folder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=empty-folder/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=empty-folder/

### double slash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=documents/

###
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=documents/work/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents//work/

### try delete .hidden directory
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=.hidden/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=.hidden/

### retry delete directory - 204 and 404
POST http://localhost:8080/api/directory?path=once/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=once/

###
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=once/

# upload files

## 201

### upload single file to root
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### upload file with subdirectory in filename
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="subfolder/TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### upload multiple files at once
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="deep_field.jpg"

< src/test/resources/test-files/deep_field.jpg
--boundary--

### upload multiple files with different subfolder
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="a/b/TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="a/b/c/deep_field.jpg"

< src/test/resources/test-files/deep_field.jpg
--boundary--

## 400

### path does not end with slash
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/file.txt
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### missing path param
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

## 409

### upload duplicate file
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

## edge cases

### upload to non-existent target folder - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=brand-new-folder/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### filename with path traversal - 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="../../etc/passwd"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### two files with same destination in one batch (duplicate in batch) - 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="same.txt"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="same.txt"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### upload deeply nested file - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=a/
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="b/c/d/TZ.md"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

### double slash in path param - 201
POST http://localhost:8080/api/resource?path=documents//
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="files"; filename="TZ.txt"

< src/test/resources/test-files/TZ.md
--boundary--

# search resources

## 200

### search existing file by full name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=TZ.md

### search by partial name (substring match)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=TZ

### search case-insensitive (uppercase query)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=tz

### search folder by name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=documents

### search by partial folder name
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=doc

### search with no matches - return empty list
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=xyznotexist123

### search with single character
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=a

### search file with extension only
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=.txt

## 400

### missing query param
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search

### empty query param
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=

### blank query (spaces only)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/resource/search?query=%20%20